  "raw": "ima Vavi\nIn its draft manifesto, Cosatu has called for the \"expropriation of land without compensation, targeted delivering of support to the people and recovery of some losses realised in the transformation of South Africa and consequential organisational restructuring\".\nEmbattled national executive committee member Zwelinzima Vavi said that the organisation would charter a ship whose cargo was the expulsion of former president Jacob Zuma and his cohorts.\nVavi, who declined to comment until he has discussed the draft with the organisation's politburo, didn't indicate which parties have been nailed down as having committed to remove Zuma.\nShithabile Shili, also a politburo member, blamed the turmoil in Cosatu as a result of the \"divisiveness of Zuma\".\n\"I don't know what is good for Cosatu. It is not democratic to put Zuma in the center of politics. America made him depart and he should be removed from Cosatu,\"",
  "serialized": "ima Vavi In its draft manifesto, Cosatu has called for the \"expropriation of land without compensation, targeted delivering of support to the people and recovery of some losses realised in the transformation of South Africa and consequential organisational restructuring\". Embattled national executive committee member Zwelinzima Vavi said that the organisation would charter a ship whose cargo was the expulsion of former president Jacob Zuma and his cohorts. Vavi, who declined to comment until he has discussed the draft with the organisation's politburo, didn't indicate which parties have been nailed down as having committed to remove Zuma. Shithabile Shili, also a politburo member, blamed the turmoil in Cosatu as a result of the \"divisiveness of Zuma\". \"I don't know what is good for Cosatu. It is not democratic to put Zuma in the center of politics. America made him depart and he should be removed from Cosatu,\"",
